        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "One year after both the conclusion of the World Heroes Battle Fest and the defeat of Zeus, invitations has been sent to the 16 fighters by Dr. Brown, informing them of a new World Heroes tournament that'll help finally settle the question of who's the strongest fighter in history. With the 16 fighters preparing themselves in order to finally determine on who's the strongest fighter in history, Zeus seeks to gain his revenge against those who had caused his downfall, but little does Zeus and the rest of the fighters know and realize that an old enemy from the past is also back and that he too has his own personal desire for revenge as well.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Un año después de la conclusión de World Heroes Battle Fest y de la derrota de Zeus, el Dr. Brown envió invitaciones a los 16 luchadores anunciándoles un nuevo torneo de World Heroes que ayudará a dirimir de una vez quién es el luchador más fuerte de la historia. Mientras los 16 luchadores se preparan para determinar al fin quién es el más fuerte de la historia, Zeus busca vengarse de quienes provocaron su caída, sin imaginar que un antiguo enemigo también ha regresado y que él también tiene su propio deseo de venganza.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1995",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
